	(descr "Cinch Connectivity (Johnson) 142-0711-821 SMA jack (female, standard polarity) end launch, 0.062 in board, 0.250 in square flange 1.65 thick, round contact dia 0.76. Land pattern per Cinch SMA end-launch table (B .070, C .170, D .380, E .165) set back 0.25 mm from the edge, centre pad tapered to a 0.30 mm CPWG. In1.Cu void under the launch (reference = In2.Cu GND). Origin = board edge (notch bottom) on the jack axis, barrel +X. https://www.cinch.com/media/product-information/products/rf-microwave/connectors/pi-ccs-john-142-0711-821.pdf")
